Subject: [PATCH] mkfs_vfat: fix -Wextra implicit-fallthrough

not_floppy skips the geometry table only; floppies still need
the 0xf0 media byte from the next cases - mark the fall.
diff --git a/util-linux/mkfs_vfat.c b/util-linux/mkfs_vfat.c
index 8213719..7821fe5 100644
--- a/util-linux/mkfs_vfat.c
+++ b/util-linux/mkfs_vfat.c
@@ -380,6 +380,7 @@ int mkfs_vfat_main(int argc UNUSED_PARAM, char **argv)
 			default:	// anything else
 				if (not_floppy)
 					goto set_cluster_size;
+				/* fall through */
 			case 2*1440:	// 3.5", 2, 18, 80 - 1440K
 			case 2*2880:	// 3.5", 2, 36, 80 - 2880K
 				media_byte = 0xf0;
